            "image": "",
            "video_muted_autoplay": true,
            "caption": "Progressive Resistance",
            "title": "<strong>12 Levels. One Trainer. For Life.</strong>",
            "title_highlight_color": "#000000",
            "text": "<p>The biggest complaint about other arm wrestling trainers? They hit the ceiling too fast. One guy on Reddit summed it up perfectly: <em>“Got strong enough in two weeks and there was nowhere to go.”</em></p><p>We fixed that. With <strong>12 distinct resistance settings</strong> — from light rehabilitation work all the way up to genuinely challenging for a seasoned gym-goer — this trainer grows with you. Pull the handle outward, shift the gear, and you’re training at the next level. Simple.</p>",
            "button_label": "GET MY ARM TRAINER",
            "button_link": "#add-to-cart",
            "atc_button_label": "",
            "atc_product": "",
            "atc_skip_cart": false
          }
