        "row_not_too_old": {
          "type": "row",
          "settings": {
            "video": "",
            "video_muted_autoplay": true,
            "caption": "Why This Trainer?",
            "title": "<strong>Built For Real Arm Strength — Not Just Looks</strong>",
            "title_highlight_color": "#000000",
            "text": "<p>Most forearm tools on the market are either too easy, fall apart after a week, or slip off your desk mid-rep (yes, we’ve all seen those suction cup disasters). This trainer is different.</p><p>The Portable Arm Wrestling Trainer uses a <strong>hydraulic resistance system</strong> that mimics the actual force you’d feel at the table. No gimmicks — just focused, progressive, functional strength training you can do solo, anywhere.</p>",
            "button_label": "GET MY ARM TRAINER",
            "button_link": "#add-to-cart",
            "atc_button_label": "",
