    "content_blocks_section_2": {
      "type": "multirow",
      "blocks": {
        "row_experts": {
          "type": "row",
          "settings": {
            "video": "",
            "video_muted_autoplay": true,
            "caption": "Feels Like the Real Thing",
            "title": "<strong>Train Like You're Already at the Table</strong>",
            "title_highlight_color": "#000000",
            "text": "<p>Generic curls and wrist rollers build muscle, sure — but they don't build <strong>arm wrestling muscle</strong>. The pulling angle, the tension curve, the way your forearm fires through the movement — it's completely different at the table.</p><p>This trainer's <strong>hydraulic resistance system</strong> is engineered to replicate that exact force curve. Every rep activates your forearms, wrists, and biceps the same way a real match would — so your strength transfers directly to performance.</p>",
            "button_label": "GET MY ARM TRAINER",
            "button_link": "#add-to-cart",
            "atc_button_label": "",
            "atc_product": "",
            "atc_skip_cart": false
          }
        },
        "row_wait": {
          "type": "row",
          "settings": {
            "image": "",
            "video_muted_autoplay": true,
            "caption": "Targeted Muscle Development",
            "title": "<strong>Hit the Muscles That Actually Win</strong>",
            "title_highlight_color": "#000000",
            "text": "<p>Arm wrestling isn’t just biceps. It’s a full-arm chain: your <strong>forearm</strong> fires first, your <strong>biceps</strong> lock the angle, and your <strong>shoulder group</strong> stabilizes the whole thing. Miss any one of these and you’ll lose to someone half your size.</p><p>This trainer is engineered to load all three, in the movement pattern that matters most. Plus it builds <strong>grip strength, wrist flexion, and pull endurance</strong> — the skills that actually decide matches.</p>",
            "button_label": "GET MY ARM TRAINER",
            "button_link": "#add-to-cart",
            "atc_button_label": "",
            "atc_product": "",
            "atc_skip_cart": false
          }
        }
      },
