            "post_author": "Michael T.",
            "post_author_avatar": "",
            "post_author_verified": false,
            "post_time": "5h ago",
            "post_text": "<p>Bought this to add focused forearm work at home, and it’s been worth every penny. The wood frame feels sturdy and not cheap at all. I like that it keeps the training focused — it’s not trying to be 10 things at once. For a dedicated arm trainer for home use, this is the one.</p>",
            "post_image": "",
            "post_reactions": "like, love, care",
