            "post_author_avatar": "",
            "post_author_verified": false,
            "post_time": "10h ago",
            "post_text": "<p>I was mainly interested in the arm-wrestling movement specifically, and this nailed it. The handle is comfortable and easy to control through the whole pull. Overall build quality is better than most niche fitness tools I’ve ordered online. Satisfied — would buy again.</p>",
            "post_image": "",
            "post_reactions": "like, love, care",
            "post_reactions_text": "845",
