            "heading": "What material is it made of?",
            "icon": "check_box",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>The frame is crafted from <strong>solid Eastern European beechwood</strong> — chosen for its density, vibration absorption, and durability. It’s reinforced with stainless steel rods throughout. No cheap plastics, no flex, no creaking under heavy resistance.</p>",
            "page": ""
          },
